 {
  "q": "Browser service: the tick closes a Browser Run session only when it can tie it to a start of its own that died. The list of sessions is for the whole Cloudflare account, with no owner. A session that this service lost in a different way lives until Browser Run's own 180 s timer. Accept?",
  "blocking": false,
